{"data": {"Commentary": [{"Over": "", "Id": "114", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "So just 13.3 overs of play today, let's hope the rain stays away in the coming games as things could get interesting. Zimbabwe might not mind this result at all as this has opened up the tournament with all the three teams in with a good chance of getting into the final. Let's see how the tri-series pans out from here. Do join us for the next game between Sri Lanka and West Indies on 23rd November at 1300 IST. Until then, it's goodbye and take care!", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "113", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "1835 IST - The match has been ABANDONED! The outfield had already taken a beating and the rain has ensured we do not get any more play. The umpires said that they went off the field due to lightning but the rain followed soon. They thought that the ground did well to recover in time but sadly the rain had the final say. Both teams share a couple of points each as a result.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "112", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "1800 IST - Nothing much to share, there will be another inspection in about half an hour. Hope they get the outfield ready till then. Stay tuned for the next inspection at 1830 IST!", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "111", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "1715 IST - There was an inspection sometime back. There is another one scheduled at 1740 IST. The outfield was already damp and has taken another beating. Let's hope for the best.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "110", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "1630 IST - The rain has relented and the covers are being taken off. Let's wait for the news on the outfield though. The cut-off time for the game is 1930 IST. Stay tuned.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "109", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "1545 IST - The rain is back, very light and the covers are back on the field. The wait prolongs......", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "108", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "1500 IST - The rain seems to have eased off but there are huge puddles on the field and it will take a marathon effort from the groundsmen to get the ground ready for play. Remember the outfield has already taken a lot of rain since yesterday. Let's keep our fingers crossed.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "107", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "1435 IST - It is absolutely pouring down and looks like we are in for a long delay. Stay tuned!", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "106", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "1415 IST - The players are going off with a threat of downpour. The covers are on the field. It always looked on the cards. It has gone very dark at the ground. Lightning seems to be an issue too. Stay tuned for the latest updates.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "13.3", "Id": "105", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "62462", "Batsman": "11690", "Commentary": "Outside off, keeps very low, Ervine plays this through covers for a single.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "13.2", "Id": "104", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "62462", "Batsman": "11690", "Commentary": "FOUR! Poor work! Shorter outside off, Ervine goes back and slaps it through covers. Shanaka comes across from deep point, slides but fails to keep the ball in play and concedes a boundary.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "13.1", "Id": "103", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "62462", "Batsman": "11690", "Commentary": "Shorter on off, tucked towards square leg from his crease.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "12.6", "Id": "102", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "59067", "Batsman": "25422", "Commentary": "Fuller outside off, comes in, Raza comes forward and defends it.", "Summary": {"Score": "50/2", "Over": "13", "Runs": "1", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "25422", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "4", "Balls": "11", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "11690", "Runs": "18", "Balls": "27", "Fours": "2", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "59067", "Overs": "2", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "5", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "12.5", "Id": "101", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "59067", "Batsman": "25422", "Commentary": "Raza stands his crease and defends this one from his crease.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "100", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "The keeper is struggling with the bees on the ground.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "12.4", "Id": "99", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "59067", "Batsman": "25422", "Commentary": "Full outside off, Raza goes for the drive but fails to connect. The keeper collects but the bowler is the only one appealing.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "12.3", "Id": "98", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "59067", "Batsman": "25422", "Commentary": "Fuller outside off, Raza plays it towards covers from his crease off the outer half of the bat.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "12.2", "Id": "97", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "59067", "Batsman": "25422", "Commentary": "Fuller outside off, Raza comes forward and defends it.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "12.2", "Id": "96", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "wd", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "59067", "Batsman": "25422", "Commentary": "WIDE! Sprays it full and wide outside off, left alone. 50 up for Zimbabwe!", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "12.1", "Id": "95", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "59067", "Batsman": "25422", "Commentary": "Outside off, left alone by Raza.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "11.6", "Id": "94", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "2", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "62462", "Batsman": "11690", "Commentary": "Ervine gets across and paddles it down to the fine leg region for a couple of runs.", "Summary": {"Score": "49/2", "Over": "12", "Runs": "5", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "11690", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "18", "Balls": "27", "Fours": "2", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "25422", "Runs": "4", "Balls": "5", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "62462", "Overs": "1", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "5", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "11.5", "Id": "93", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "62462", "Batsman": "11690", "Commentary": "What's going on? Another run out chance! Floated on middle, Ervine clips it towards mid-wicket and looks for a single. Raza sends him back late. The throw comes in from square leg but it does not hit the stumps and the keeper fumbles as well. Ervine dives to get back into his crease. Mendis was the fielder there. Had that hit the stumps or the keeper collected it cleanly, Ervine was a goner!", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "11.4", "Id": "92", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "62462", "Batsman": "25422", "Commentary": "Floated outside off, Raza drives it off the outer half towards gully for a single.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "11.3", "Id": "91", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "62462", "Batsman": "11690", "Commentary": "Turns it through mid-wicket for a quick single.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "11.2", "Id": "90", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "62462", "Batsman": "25422", "Commentary": "Shorter outside off, Raza places it wide of the cover-point fielder for a single.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "89", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "The groundsmen are getting ready, expecting rains.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "11.1", "Id": "88", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "62462", "Batsman": "25422", "Commentary": "Bowls it on off, Raza defends it from his crease.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "87", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "SACHITH PATHIRANA comes into the attack.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "10.6", "Id": "86", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57440", "Batsman": "11690", "Commentary": "Floated on off, Ervine drives it to covers.", "Summary": {"Score": "44/2", "Over": "11", "Runs": "4", "Wickets": "1", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "11690", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "15", "Balls": "24", "Fours": "2", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "25422", "Runs": "2", "Balls": "2", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "57440", "Overs": "1", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "4", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "10.5", "Id": "85", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57440", "Batsman": "25422", "Commentary": "Flatter on middle, Raza clips it towards mid-wicket for a single.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "10.4", "Id": "84", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57440", "Batsman": "11690", "Commentary": "Outside off, pushed through covers for a single.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "10.3", "Id": "83", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57440", "Batsman": "25422", "Commentary": "Drives it through mid on for a single to get off the mark.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "82", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "SIKANDAR RAZA comes in to bat.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "10.2", "Id": "81", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "W", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57440", "Batsman": "40476", "Commentary": "OUT! RUN OUT! Rookie error by Chari! de Silva bowls it on middle and leg, Chari tucks it towards mid-wicket and looks for a single. He is way down the track and is sent back late by Craig Ervine. Kusal Mendis comes in from mid-wicket and fires the throw at the keeper who does the rest. Chari slipped a touch and dived to get back but was caught short of the crease. Very immature stuff by Chari.", "Iswicket": true, "Dismissed": "40476", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "10.1", "Id": "80", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "57440", "Batsman": "11690", "Commentary": "Floated outside off, driven through mid off for a single.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "79", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "DHANANJAYA DE SILVA comes into the attack.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "78", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Powerplay 2 is signaled by the umpire.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "9.6", "Id": "77", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "2", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "59067", "Batsman": "40476", "Commentary": "Angled on a fuller length on off, comes in, worked through backward square leg for a couple of runs.", "Summary": {"Score": "40/1", "Over": "10", "Runs": "4", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "40476", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "11", "Balls": "24", "Fours": "1", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "11690", "Runs": "13", "Balls": "21", "Fours": "2", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "59067", "Overs": "1", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "4", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "9.5", "Id": "76", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "59067", "Batsman": "40476", "Commentary": "Fuller outside off, Chari drives it hard but finds the fielder at short cover who dives to his right and stops it superbly.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "9.4", "Id": "75", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "59067", "Batsman": "11690", "Commentary": "Good length outside off, punched off the back foot towards point from his crease. There is a slight misfield and that allows a single.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "9.3", "Id": "74", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "59067", "Batsman": "40476", "Commentary": "Outside off, dabbed behind point for a single.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "9.2", "Id": "73", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "59067", "Batsman": "40476", "Commentary": "Too full outside off, Chari mistimes his drive towards mid on. He looks for a single but it is not on.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "9.1", "Id": "72", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "59067", "Batsman": "40476", "Commentary": "Fuller outside off, Chari mistimes his drive on the bounce towards short cover.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "71", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "DASUN SHANAKA is brought into the attack.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "8.6", "Id": "70", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3530", "Batsman": "40476", "Commentary": "Outside off on a length, dabbed down to third man for a single.", "Summary": {"Score": "36/1", "Over": "9", "Runs": "4", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "40476", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "8", "Balls": "19", "Fours": "1", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "11690", "Runs": "12", "Balls": "20", "Fours": "2", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "3530", "Overs": "5", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "17", "Wickets": "1"}]}, "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "8.5", "Id": "69", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3530", "Batsman": "11690", "Commentary": "Length ball on off, Ervine flicks it nicely through mid-wicket for a run.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "68", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Play held up as the landing area for the bowlers seems to be under the scanner. The hammer is out in the middle. The batsmen take an unofficial drinks break.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "8.4", "Id": "67", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3530", "Batsman": "11690", "Commentary": "Ervine pushes it towards point from his crease. A direct hit at the non-striker's end but no harm done.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "8.3", "Id": "66", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "lb", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3530", "Batsman": "40476", "Commentary": "Length ball on the pads, Chari fails to clip and the ball goes towards short fine leg for a leg bye. Chari wanted to hit that too hard and hence failed to put bat to ball.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "8.2", "Id": "65", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3530", "Batsman": "11690", "Commentary": "Fuller on off, Ervine pushes it in the air towards mid on from the inside half of the bat. A single taken.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "8.1", "Id": "64", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3530", "Batsman": "11690", "Commentary": "Slants on a length outside off, Ervine lunges forward and defends it.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "7.6", "Id": "63", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "5388", "Batsman": "11690", "Commentary": "Bowls it on middle and leg, comes in, Ervine works it through mid-wicket for a single. He signals to the dressing room that he wants to get rid of the jumper.", "Summary": {"Score": "32/1", "Over": "8", "Runs": "9", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "11690", "Isonstrike