estone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "5.3", "Id": "48", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "5388", "Batsman": "11690", "Commentary": "Fuller on off, Ervine comes forward and pushes it to mid off.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "5.2", "Id": "47", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "5388", "Batsman": "11690", "Commentary": "Slanted on a length across Ervine who lets it go safely. That was well left.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "5.1", "Id": "46", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "5388", "Batsman": "40476", "Commentary": "EDGED! Outside off, shapes away, Chari comes forward to defend but gets an outside edge through gully for a single.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "4.6", "Id": "45", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3530", "Batsman": "11690", "Commentary": "Good length on off, Ervine defends it from his crease.", "Summary": {"Score": "20/1", "Over": "5", "Runs": "6", "Wickets": "1", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "11690", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "0", "Balls": "1", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "40476", "Runs": "5", "Balls": "14", "Fours": "1", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "3530", "Overs": "3", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "12", "Wickets": "1"}]}, "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "44", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "CRAIG ERVINE walks in at number 3.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "4.5", "Id": "43", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "W", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3530", "Batsman": "3713", "Commentary": "OUT! PLUMB! Bowls it outside off, comes in a touch, Chibhabha looks to clip it but misses and is rapped on the pads. The players go up in an appeal and the umpire upholds it. Chibhabha has a chat with Chari but does not take the review. Replays confirm the ball was hitting the leg stump. Kulasekara strikes for Sri Lanka, nice set up by him. He bowled many that went away and brought this one in!", "Iswicket": true, "Dismissed": "3713", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "4.4", "Id": "42", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3530", "Batsman": "3713", "Commentary": "FOUR! EXTRAVAGANT! Fuller outside off, Chibhabha again waits for it and crashes it through covers for a boundary. Superbly hit.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "4.3", "Id": "41", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3530", "Batsman": "3713", "Commentary": "Bowls it outside off, left alone by Chibhabha.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "40", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Square leg in place now as fine leg goes a bit deep. Mid-wicket comes over to first slip.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "4.2", "Id": "39", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3530", "Batsman": "40476", "Commentary": "Fuller outside off, driven past the diving cover fielder for a single as the mid off fielder goes to his left and stops it.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "4.1", "Id": "38", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3530", "Batsman": "40476", "Commentary": "Bowls the inswinger from outside off, Chari comes forward to defend but gets an inside edge onto his body.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "4.1", "Id": "37", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "wd", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3530", "Batsman": "40476", "Commentary": "WIDE! Full and sliding down leg, Chari looks to clip it away but misses. A wide signaled.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "3.6", "Id": "36", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "5388", "Batsman": "3713", "Commentary": "Waits for this shorter one  to come and guides it towards point from his crease. Maiden from Lakmal!", "Summary": {"Score": "14/0", "Over": "4", "Runs": "0", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "3713", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "4", "Balls": "12", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "40476", "Runs": "4", "Balls": "12", "Fours": "1", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "5388", "Overs": "2", "Maidens": "1", "Runs": "4", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "3.5", "Id": "35", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "5388", "Batsman": "3713", "Commentary": "Good length outside off, Chibhabha comes forward and defends it.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "3.4", "Id": "34", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "5388", "Batsman": "3713", "Commentary": "Fuller outside off, Chibhabha drives it hard but finds the fielder at short cover.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "3.3", "Id": "33", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "5388", "Batsman": "3713", "Commentary": "This time Chibhabha lets it go through safely.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "3.2", "Id": "32", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "5388", "Batsman": "3713", "Commentary": "Full again outside off, Chibhabha drives it to mid off from his crease off the inner half of the bat.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "3.1", "Id": "31", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "5388", "Batsman": "3713", "Commentary": "BEATEN! Bowls it outside off, Chibhabha looks to drive but is beaten by the away swing on that one.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "2.6", "Id": "30", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3530", "Batsman": "40476", "Commentary": "On a length on middle and leg, Chari clips it toward short fine leg.", "Summary": {"Score": "14/0", "Over": "3", "Runs": "9", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "40476", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "4", "Balls": "12", "Fours": "1", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "3713", "Runs": "4", "Balls": "6", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "3530", "Overs": "2", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "6", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "2.5", "Id": "29", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3530", "Batsman": "40476", "Commentary": "Good length on off, Chari defends it from his crease.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "2.4", "Id": "28", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Isboundary": true, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3530", "Batsman": "40476", "Commentary": "FOUR! CRASHED! Full outside off, asking to be hit, Chari obliges and thumps it hard through covers for a boundary. Superb shot, that!", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "2.4", "Id": "27", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "wd", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3530", "Batsman": "40476", "Commentary": "WIDE! Slips this one down the leg side for a wide.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "2.3", "Id": "26", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3530", "Batsman": "40476", "Commentary": "Comes forward and pushes it to covers.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "2.2", "Id": "25", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3530", "Batsman": "40476", "Commentary": "Shout for an lbw but not given! Angled on a length outside off, comes in sharply, Chari is hit on his back leg as he fails to defend it. Loud appeal from the bowler but nothing from the umpire. Replays confirm it was missing the stumps.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "2.1", "Id": "24", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "4", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "lb", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3530", "Batsman": "40476", "Commentary": "FOUR LEG BYES! Bowls it on middle, Chari looks to clip but gets it off the pads as the ball runs down to the fine leg fence. Lakmal tried to stop it from short fine leg but dived over the ball.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "1.6", "Id": "23", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "5388", "Batsman": "3713", "Commentary": "On a length on off, Chibhabha defends it towards square leg from his crease.", "Summary": {"Score": "5/0", "Over": "2", "Runs": "4", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "3713", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "4", "Balls": "6", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "40476", "Runs": "0", "Balls": "6", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "5388", "Overs": "1", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "4", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "1.5", "Id": "22", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "5388", "Batsman": "3713", "Commentary": "Length ball on off, Chibhabha tucks it towards mid-wicket from his crease.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "1.4", "Id": "21", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "5388", "Batsman": "3713", "Commentary": "Fuller outside off, Chibhabha drives it towards covers from his crease.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "1.3", "Id": "20", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "5388", "Batsman": "3713", "Commentary": "Fuller outside off, driven back down the wicket by Chibhabha. Lakmal collects with his right hand and fires it back past the batsman. Not needed from Lakmal, could have just booked a meeting with the officials later.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "1.2", "Id": "19", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "2", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "5388", "Batsman": "3713", "Commentary": "Good shot! On a length outside off, Chibhabha stands tall and punches it through covers. Two runs taken.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "1.1", "Id": "18", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "2", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "5388", "Batsman": "3713", "Commentary": "Good length on middle, Chibhabha tucks it through backward square leg. Calls for a couple and completes them easily.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "17", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "SURANGA LAKMAL is the bowler from the other end.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "0.6", "Id": "16", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3530", "Batsman": "40476", "Commentary": "Gets across the line and pushes it towards mid on but not for any runs.", "Summary": {"Score": "1/0", "Over": "1", "Runs": "1", "Wickets": "0", "Batsmen": [{"Batsman": "40476", "Isonstrike": true, "Runs": "0", "Balls": "6", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "0"}, {"Batsman": "3713", "Runs": "0", "Balls": "0", "Fours": "0", "Sixes": "0"}], "Bowlers": [{"Bowler": "3530", "Overs": "1", "Maidens": "0", "Runs": "1", "Wickets": "0"}]}, "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "0.5", "Id": "15", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3530", "Batsman": "40476", "Commentary": "BEATEN! Outside off, does not get up much, Chari comes down a touch and looks to play it through covers but misses and the ball dies down to the keeper. Signs of things to follow?", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "0.4", "Id": "14", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3530", "Batsman": "40476", "Commentary": "On a length outside off, Chari comes forward and pushes it towards covers.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "0.4", "Id": "13", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "1", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "wd", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3530", "Batsman": "40476", "Commentary": "WIDE! Slips this one down the leg side, Chari cannot clip it. The ball dies down to the keeper. A wide is signaled.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "0.3", "Id": "12", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3530", "Batsman": "40476", "Commentary": "Outside off on a length, Chari comes forward and defends it.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "0.2", "Id": "11", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3530", "Batsman": "40476", "Commentary": "Pitched up outside off, Chari comes forward and pushes it towards mid off.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "0.1", "Id": "10", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "0", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": true, "Bowler": "3530", "Batsman": "40476", "Commentary": "Fuller outside off, Chari comes forward and pushes it towards cover-point.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "9", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "1305 IST - Woah! That was quick, the rain has gone and the covers are off as well. The players are out in the middle. BRIAN CHARI and CHAMU CHIBHABHA are the two openers for Zimbabwe. SRI LANKA begin with NUWAN KULASEKARA! Here we go...", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "8", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "1255 IST - Oh dear, it is RAINING NOW and the covers are on the field. Let's hope it is a short delay.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "7", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "PITCH REPORT - The outfield is damp and soggy so it will be slow. There is a new pitch in the offering today. Pat Symcox reckons it has less grass on it, well rolled over. Calls it a good cricket pitch with less spin and plenty of runs on it.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "6", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "SRI LANKA XI - Dhananjaya de Silva, Kusal Perera, Niroshan Dickwella(wk), Kusal Mendis, Upul Tharanga(c), Dasun Shanaka, Asela Gunaratne, Sachith Pathirana, Nuwan Kulasekara, Suranga Lakmal, Jeffrey Vandersay.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "5", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "ZIMBABWE XI - Brian Chari, Chamu Chibhabha, Craig Ervine, Sikandar Raza, Sean Williams, Peter Moor(wk), Elton Chigumbura, Graeme Cremer(c), Donald Tiripano, Chris Mpofu, Tendai Chisoro.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "4", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Upul Tharanga says they were hoping to bat first. Two changes for them. Jeffrey Vandersay and Dasun Shanaka come in for Nuwan Pradeep and Shehan Jayasuriya.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "3", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Graeme Cremer reckons it is a similar wicket, adds they were few runs short in the last game. Hopes that today they can change it around. Credits his team for playing exceptionally. Mentions that they need to improve their fielding since it could have given them a win. Adds that he wants his batsmen to maximize any start they get. Hopes the crowd comes in to support them. They are unchanged from the previous game.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "2", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "TOSS - ZIMBABWE WIN THE TOSS AND OPT TO BAT! So they have again backed the deck to slow down as the game progresses and spinners to come into play. The hosts are unchanged from the previous game. Sri Lanka have made a couple of changes. We'll have the teams for you in a bit.", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}, {"Over": "", "Id": "1", "UID": null, "OID": null, "Runs": "", "ZAD": null, "Detail": "", "Isball": false, "Bowler": "", "Batsman": "", "Commentary": "Hello and a warm welcome for the 4th game of the tri-series, between Zimbabwe and Sri Lanka in Bulawayo. The hosts would be high on confidence as they earned a sensational tie against West Indies in their previous clash. However, it is a must win match for the home side and they need to put in their best effort to upset Sri Lanka who are a bunch of talented cricketers. On the other hand, the islanders lost their way in their previous encounter against the Windies and would look to script a strong turnaround this time. A lot still remains at stake!", "Milestone": null, "Edited_Commentary": 0, "Default_Commentary": "", "Shot_Type_Id": "", "Shot_Type": ""}], "Deleted_UID": null}, "meta": {"app_status_code": 1, "message": "Success", "pagination": true, "count": 114, "timestamp": {"utc_time": "6/20/2026 7:13:26 AM"}}}